      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We are deeply sorry that your breakfast experience fell short of our standards; a cold meal, limited options, and staff disinterest are never acceptable at Linden Boutique. Please let us know where you dined so our Manager can personally apologize to you and ensure these issues are fully addressed. We aim to see you again soon and make this right.",
